  "question": {
    "text": "Let the point $P$ of the focal chord $P Q$ of the parabola $y^2=16 x$ be $(1,-4)$. If the focus of the parabola divides the chord PQ in the ratio $\\mathrm{m}: \\mathrm{n}$, $\\operatorname{gcd}(m, n)=1$, then $m^2+n^2$ is equal to :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "frUoQ",
      "text": "$17$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
